# Exclude large binary files that should be downloaded
# roms/*.rom

# Not a commented-out intention any more.  CLAUDE.md's standing rule is that
# every disk image comes from the ioscpm release area pinned by RELEASE_TAG and
# that nothing is bundled in any package; disks/cpm_wbw.img and
# disks/zsys_wbw.img were the last two tracked here, they were what the deleted
# MainWindow::loadDefaultDisks() wanted, and no packaging script has staged them
# since dbd53b1.  This is what stops the next one being committed by accident.
disks/*.img

# Upstream repos (pulled for reference)
upstream/

# Test output artifacts
nul
dist/
